{"completed": true, "response": "计数口径：`items_now` 只统计各段的主体条目，不把嵌套的「←」前因说明和「⟲」回环标记另算。排序主要考虑心理转折是否完整、前因是否成立，以及实际交给视频后是否容易读懂。\n\n```json\n{\n  \"ranking\": [\"图B\", \"图A\", \"图C\"],\n  \"graphs\": {\n    \"图A\": {\n      \"why_now\": 8,\n      \"center\": 8,\n      \"history_connection\": 8,\n      \"insight\": 7,\n      \"accumulation\": 8,\n      \"faithful\": 9,\n      \"standalone\": 9,\n      \"efficiency\": 4,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 7,\n      \"words\": 4,\n      \"glance\": 4,\n      \"items_now\": 92,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 78,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"4–16\",\n          \"quote\": \"“自由地给予温柔”后又写“认真在乎一个人不一定带来不安”“不必抓住什么”\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"4–16\",\n          \"quote\": \"“反而比先前更自在”\",\n          \"type\": \"可省细节\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"4–16\",\n          \"quote\": \"←（1–3）“无事待决仍谨慎”\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"24–34\",\n          \"quote\": \"“关心、给予……本来就是实实在在的快乐”与“珍惜一个人并不是凡事都要得到相应表示”\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"24–34\",\n          \"quote\": \"“更愿意付出”“不再小心衡量心意的多少”“不再担心多给一点”“因不计较回报而感到幸福”\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"78–83\",\n          \"quote\": \"“不必因想靠近就马上向前”与“带着愿望安静喜欢，也承认自己没有把握”\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"84–92\",\n          \"quote\": \"“不再躲避感情的深度”“过去让他警惕的愿望……可以一同存在”“仍然可能受伤……仍愿充分承认幸福”\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"93–102\",\n          \"quote\": \"“暂时不再以缺憾的样子折磨他”“仿佛已经没有什么需要再增加”“所有心愿仿佛同时得到了抒发”\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"103–110\",\n          \"quote\": \"“不愿把自己的安稳完全交给对方”与“不想让那个人负责消除他全部的不安”\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"111–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"“仍然希望得到回应，却不再用回应的有无来判定真心”后又写“愿意继续……认真地喜欢”“可以如此渴望被爱”“没有得到想要的一切，却不再……放弃爱”\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"1–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"大量条目连续以“他……”“他不……”“他仍……”起句\",\n          \"type\": \"句式单一\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"1–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"“投入与自我克制始终相互牵制”“心里越发丰盈”“没有着落的盼望”等抽象表达反复出现\",\n          \"type\": \"抽象词\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 6,\n      \"verdict\": \"内容最完整，心理变化和前因大体忠实，积累标签也基本准确；但同一认识经常被拆成几条反复陈述，结尾尤其拥挤，句式和抽象用词也容易形成AI式的整齐感，需要明显剪辑后才适合上屏。\"\n    },\n    \"图B\": {\n      \"why_now\": 9,\n      \"center\": 8,\n      \"history_connection\": 8,\n      \"insight\": 8,\n      \"accumulation\": 8,\n      \"faithful\": 8,\n      \"standalone\": 9,\n      \"efficiency\": 8,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 8,\n      \"words\": 7,\n      \"glance\": 7,\n      \"items_now\": 74,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 65,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"1–3\",\n          \"quote\": \"“明明眼下没人催他决定什么”\",\n          \"type\": \"编造\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"4–16\",\n          \"quote\": \"“也能自在……甚至比从前更轻松”\",\n          \"type\": \"可省细节\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"17–23\",\n          \"quote\": \"“他也看见了界限”\",\n          \"type\": \"抽象词\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"40–50\",\n          \"quote\": \"“于是先看眼前：愿意关心就关心，盼对方好、安静惦念”\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"111–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"“这些快乐没解决最后的问题，却没有白费；它们让他一次次愿意继续向前”\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"111–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"“愿意继续把这个人放在心里”后又写“渴望被爱而不把渴望变成义务”及“没得到想要的一切，却不再……放弃爱”\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"111–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"“他仍盼回应”“他愿继续”“他可以渴望”“他没得到想要的一切”\",\n          \"type\": \"句式单一\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 8,\n      \"verdict\": \"三者中最均衡：关键前因、错误预期被推翻的过程、两难以及暂时的缓解都保留下来，且大部分条目一眼就能读懂；主要不足是末段仍稍长，遗漏了先前那些快乐如何让他终于看清这个人有多重要。\"\n    },\n    \"图C\": {\n      \"why_now\": 6,\n      \"center\": 7,\n      \"history_connection\": 6,\n      \"insight\": 6,\n      \"accumulation\": 6,\n      \"faithful\": 6,\n      \"standalone\": 7,\n      \"efficiency\": 8,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 7,\n      \"words\": 7,\n      \"glance\": 8,\n      \"items_now\": 68,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 62,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"24–34\",\n          \"quote\": \"“他不想让喜欢变成对对方的无形催促”\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"40–50\",\n          \"quote\": \"“因此他转而只留心当下确实愿意给予的关切”\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"51–61\",\n          \"quote\": \"“从前以为能轻轻放在心里的喜欢，如今渐渐有了重量”与“喜欢渐渐变重”\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"51–61\",\n          \"quote\": \"“他仍不催促对方，却常独自想着对方是否也会靠近”\",\n          \"type\": \"编造\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"51–61\",\n          \"quote\": \"“他仍不催促对方”\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"72–77\",\n          \"quote\": \"“想知道对方是否同样渴望靠近”\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"93–102\",\n          \"quote\": \"“那一刻，他仿佛觉得所有心愿都已得到抒发”\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"103–110\",\n          \"quote\": \"“他能决定自己爱得多深，却不能替对方决定要不要同样爱他”\",\n          \"type\": \"编造\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"111–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"“他喜欢得很深，也坦承盼被选择，却仍收住心意，因为对方未必同样想要”\",\n          \"type\": \"编造\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"111–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"“他知道未来仍可能失望、想要更多或因无法更近而疼痛，却不因此否认感情、催促对方或放弃爱”\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"111–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"“他曾努力收住，也曾尽情投入，因此知道两种办法都不能免去爱人的风险”\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 5,\n      \"verdict\": \"读起来最轻、最容易扫视，但压缩越过了几个真正的心理台阶：93–102的满足如何形成没有交代充分，51–61把未着落的盼望改写成了更具体的念头，结尾又弱化了他既不否认自己的渴望、也不拿克制证明清醒的认识，因此不能只凭简洁就判为更好。\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "14990459-b4a1-4016-9dcc-16325f80c55e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261022T025307193063Z", "elapsed_seconds": 343.766, "completed_utc": "2026-10-22T02:58:50.967199+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "476cb1b56f41f107b14a975b1feaef7961a0e8cc05daefdb48ba5995f6b11de8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261022T025307193063Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "80648f538ca12063a98b6061da74f7cae49efde3217362e472c7bea5b4de2503"}}}
